      "description": "Negative by convention. The archive shows CROCR19/R29 at \u221290 V and CROC3D at \u22129 V. CAUTION: when a Keithley's output is off it logs its SETPOINT here, not a measurement \u2014 a flat healthy-looking line with 0 A beside it means 'not biasing'. Check the leakage panel to tell them apart.",
